<view class="flow-steps" aria-label="填写流程共三步，当前第一步：答题"><view class="flow-step flow-step--active"><text class="flow-step__num">1</text><text class="flow-step__label">答题</text></view><view class="flow-step__bar"></view><view class="flow-step"><text class="flow-step__num">2</text><text class="flow-step__label">菜品与小票</text></view><view class="flow-step__bar"></view><view class="flow-step"><text class="flow-step__num">3</text><text class="flow-step__label">其他记录</text></view></view><view class="survey-tabs"><button wx:for="{{categories}}" wx:key="id" class="{{category === item.id ? 'active' : ''}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="selectCategory"><text>{{item.label}}</text></button></view><view class="survey-status">已完成 {{answeredCount}} / {{questions.length}} · {{syncMessage}}</view><view wx:if="{{conflict}}" class="conflict-banner"><text>问卷内容已在其他位置更新，为避免覆盖已有记录，请刷新后继续。</text><button class="conflict-banner__action" bindtap="retry">重新加载</button></view><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="page muted">正在加载问卷…</view><view wx:elif="{{error}}" class="page"><view class="card"><text>{{error}}</text><button class="primary" bindtap="retry">重新加载</button></view></view><view wx:else class="question-list"><view wx:for="{{visible}}" wx:key="id" class="question-card"><view class="question-meta"><text>{{item.number}}</text></view><text class="question-text {{item.expanded ? 'expanded' : ''}}">{{item.text}}</text><text wx:if="{{item.isScoreWipe}}" class="score-wipe-tag">本题选「是」将清零本类全部得分</text><button class="expand" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="toggleExpand">{{item.expanded ? '收起' : '查看全部'}}</button><view wx:if="{{item.current && item.current.answer === 'unscored'}}" class="issue-summary">{{item.current.remark}}</view><view class="answer-actions"><button class="{{item.current && item.current.answer === 'scored' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="score">{{item.isScoreWipe ? '否' : '得分'}}</button><button class="{{item.current && item.current.answer === 'unscored' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="issue">{{item.isScoreWipe ? '是' : '不得分'}}</button></view></view><button wx:if="{{isLastCategory}}" class="primary dishes-next" bindtap="dishes">下一步：菜品与小票</button></view>
